66c2d5e100defbc60453b58d838d3139e16b6.jpg", "head_cover": "", "content": "　　猎奇在中文的本意原是指“搜寻奇异特殊的事物”。但在ACG界中，猎奇被引申有“血腥、残酷”一类之意。据信猎奇一词被大量引用，出自日本ACG的18禁的猎奇杀人（猎奇杀人）类型的虚构作品，对于此种类型的简称。\r\n概要与用法\r\n　　在ACG界中，猎奇可指任何血腥、暴力而残酷的事物，并作为形容词使用，\r\n此外，猎奇也可被当作动词使用。以人为主词时，通常作被动语态，例如：“某角色被猎奇了”；以事为主词，则主要用主动语态，", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "17391": {"data": {"tag_id": 17391, "tag_name": "惊悚", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "28568": {"data": {"tag_id": 28568, "tag_name": "攻略解说", "cover": "", "head_cover": "", "content": "", "short_content": "", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 1}, "day_count": 1}, "17941": {"data": {"tag_id": 17941, "tag_name": "恐怖游戏", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4141ba3b7f95407af20d44e7b28c328f0f52d8ee.jpg", "head_cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a3589c26ee0c290e6e2f8094ae0bdf47152de60b.png", "content": "恐怖游戏，让你心惊胆战的游戏体验！", "short_content": "胆小勿入！", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 1436866637, "count": {"view": 0, "use": 0, "atten": 0}, "is_atten": 0, "likes": 0, "hates": 0, "attribute": 0, "liked": 0, "hated": 0, "extra_attr": 0}, "day_count": 1}, "33450": {"data": {"tag_id": 33450, "tag_name": "独立游戏", "cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1c9e3be52a54dcf883951d5524992c8494b66449.jpg", "head_cover": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8a64bb7da78196979721c09fd9ebfaf605cbe9ad.jpg", "content": "不用于传统发行渠道发布的游戏。", "short_content": "独立游戏，是一种精神。", "type": 3, "state": 0, "ctime": 143686